      "writtenOn": "2025-11-11T00:34:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is only needed for the legacy kernel driver in 6.1 and older. Once this has been merged, I\u0027ll cherry pick to the other previous kernels back to android12-5.10. 6.6 and 6.12 have my refactored android_f_accessory driver which is (more) properly tied into the configfs framework. The intent is for 6.18 to be replaced solely by userspace aoa, but we are still working to resolve issues with that.",
      "parentUuid": "a1922a6c_86f31ae0",
      "revId": "3e41a94be9d1808ec96ee6500ed20f9ff72b0fb7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
